        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>This module captures raw 5-bit character inputs from the keyboard interface. It identifies word boundaries via spaces and detects 
special punctuation. Valid letters are immediately streamed to the hashing engine, while boundary markers trigger word-flushing 
and sentence-length tracking to manage front-end text parsing.</string>
